      "created_at": "2018-06-22T20:15:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m fairly new to Sentinel Comics (only have been playing for a few months, and just made this account today), and I have two questions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1: What is the best place to find Sentinel Comic Lore? I have read a quite of few wiki articles, and listened to a few Letters Page episodes. Any other suggestions?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2: I play Sentinels of the Multiverse on my phone daily (I have both seasons), and was curious if I should buy the physical game or something like Tactics. What would be your suggestion?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:25.406Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
