      "raw": "<p>I&rsquo;m fairly new to Sentinel Comics (only have been playing for a few months, and just made this account today), and I have two questions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1: What is the best place to find Sentinel Comic Lore? I have read a quite of few wiki articles, and listened to a few Letters Page episodes. Any other suggestions?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2: I play Sentinels of the Multiverse on my phone daily (I have both seasons), and was curious if I should buy the physical game or something like Tactics. What would be your suggestion?</p>",
