      "created_at": "2018-06-22T21:16:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Do you know if I can still back Sentinels of Freedom on Kickstarter?</p><p>I have a few friends and family who would like playing Sentinels also. One of the reasons I want the physical game is so I can try variant modes of play (e.g. PvP, Combined Decks, 2 Character Mode).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT: Also being able to use custom cards (e.g. The Cauldron) would be cool.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
