      "created_at": "2018-06-23T08:51:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>And there's always Tabletop Sim if you want access to all of the everything that's available right now (including the Cauldron) - lots of people play games there. It's kind of the second-best thing to playing at an actual tabletop :). You can probably find players pretty easily via the Discord server if that sounds good.</p><p>Also, welcome to the forum :).</p>",
